sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser
    participant DNS as Recursive resolver
    participant Server as IP address from DNS
    Browser->>DNS: Query hostname (only on cache miss)
    DNS-->>Browser: A / AAAA answer and TTL
    Browser->>Server: TCP connect to port 443 (or QUIC for HTTP/3)
    Browser->>Server: TLS handshake with hostname/SNI
    Server-->>Browser: Certificate chain
    Browser->>Browser: Validate CA chain, dates, hostname/SAN
    Browser->>Server: Encrypted HTTP GET /path
    Server-->>Browser: Status + headers + body or Location redirect